================================================================================
Statement of changes (Apache-2.0 section 4b)
================================================================================

Retrieved 2026-07-23. Modified 2026-07-25.

This directory began as the upstream `cloudflare` skill. Seven further upstream
skills, each previously distributed as its own top-level skill, were folded into
its references/ tree. Their content is unmodified; only its location changed.

  upstream skill            ->  location in this directory
  ------------------------      --------------------------------------------
  agents-sdk                ->  references/agents-sdk/     (19 topic files;
                                SKILL.md body -> guide.md)
  workers-best-practices    ->  references/workers/        (rules.md, review.md;
                                SKILL.md body -> guide.md)
  durable-objects           ->  references/durable-objects/ (rules.md,
                                testing.md, workers.md; body -> guide.md)
  sandbox-sdk               ->  references/sandbox/        (api-quick-ref.md,
                                examples.md; body -> guide.md)
  cloudflare-email-service  ->  references/email-workers/  (5 files;
                                body -> guide.md)
  wrangler                  ->  references/wrangler/guide.md
  turnstile-spin            ->  references/turnstile/      (framework snippets,
                                scripts/, tests/; body -> spin.md;
                                README.md -> spin-README.md)

Each relocated `guide.md` and `spin.md` carries a header naming the upstream
skill it came from.

Changes to upstream files themselves, in full:

  - SKILL.md: the `description` frontmatter field was rewritten to cover the
    merged scope, and a "Deep Guides" routing table was added so the skill can
    reach the relocated material. No other section was altered.

No upstream file was deleted, truncated, or rewritten. The pre-consolidation
state is preserved verbatim in this repository's git history at commit 42caf2b.
